    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only bagels can move the ball properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whoever scores the most goals within 5 minutes wins the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play 1v1 or 2v2, on a variety of maps (currently 4, i plan for more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >utilise the unique physics properties of the bagels to propel yourself across the map, as well as the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use the practice mode to get to grips with the unique movement system within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lobby browser makes it easy to set up a match with your friends, or find a match with another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >join a game before it starts to spectate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >peer-to-peer netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bagelball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >left click to pick up bagel/drop bagel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wasd to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shift to sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scroll wheel to make bagel close and far</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ctrl to fastfall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >right click to quantum switch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >space to jump, space while in the air to double jump, space while on a wall to wall jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >jump onto a bagel underneath you while in close mode to start flying</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only bagels can move the ball properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whoever scores the most goals within 5 minutes wins the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play 1v1 or 2v2, on a variety of maps (currently 4, i plan for more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >utilise the unique physics properties of the bagels to propel yourself across the map, as well as the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use the practice mode to get to grips with the unique movement system within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lobby browser makes it easy to set up a match with your friends, or find a match with another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >join a game before it starts to spectate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >peer-to-peer netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bagelball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >left click to pick up bagel/drop bagel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wasd to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shift to sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scroll wheel to make bagel close and far</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ctrl to fastfall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >right click to quantum switch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >space to jump, space while in the air to double jump, space while on a wall to wall jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >jump onto a bagel underneath you while in close mode to start flying</p>",
    "short_description": "bagelball is a physics &amp; movement-based multiplayer sports-ish game, similar to the game with cars and footballs, except instead of driving a car you wield a bagel. you can ride the bagel to fly, throw bagels at high velocity, and wall jump, all to score the most goals within 5 minutes.",
